---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import ToolCard from '../../components/ToolCard.astro';
import Bundles from '../../components/Bundles.astro';
import tools from '../../data/tools.json';
---
<Base title="Tools for every part of your season"><section class="section page-head"><span class="eyebrow section-kicker">The coach’s toolkit / 9 tools</span><h1>Tools for every part<br/>of your season.</h1><p>Excel tools and game-day apps. Built around the work you do. Checkout runs securely through Stan.</p><div class="role-chooser" aria-label="Your role"><span>Make it yours.</span><button data-role-choice="hc" aria-pressed="false">I coach</button><button data-role-choice="vc" aria-pressed="false">I run video</button><button data-role-choice="rc" aria-pressed="false">I recruit</button></div></section><section class="section catalog" aria-label="Tools catalog"><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter tools by category">{[['all','All','9'],['game-day','Game day','3'],['scouting-lineups','Scouting & lineups','3'],['recruiting','Recruiting','3']].map(([value,label,count])=><button data-filter={value} aria-pressed={value==='all'}>{label}<small>{count}</small></button>)}</div><p class="eyebrow" id="result-count" aria-live="polite" style="margin-bottom:24px">9 tools</p><div class="tool-grid" id="catalog-grid">{tools.map((tool,index)=><ToolCard tool={tool} index={index}/>)}</div></section><Bundles/><section class="section faq"><span class="eyebrow section-kicker">A few things to know</span><h2>Before you tip off.</h2><details><summary>Do I need Excel?</summary><p>The Five-Player Lineup Simulator is an Excel tool. The Live Play Call Tracker is a web app. Requirements for the other tools are awaiting confirmation; check the individual Stan listing before purchasing.</p></details><details><summary>Where do I buy and get my tool?</summary><p>Every purchase is handled through Jackson’s Stan store. Follow the product link for checkout and delivery details.</p></details><details><summary>Can you customise a tool for my program?</summary><p>Tell Jackson about your workflow through the <a class="text-link" href="/custom-apps/">Custom Apps request page →</a></p></details><details><summary>What is the refund policy?</summary><p>The policy is awaiting confirmation. Check the Stan listing or contact Jackson before you purchase.</p></details></section></Base>
